   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component aims to support a) refugee related employment and protection b)improving broader investment climate and services reform c) improving labour productivity and d) enhancing environmental and social issues around industrial parks.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity This component aims to support a) refugee related employment and protection b)improving broader investment climate and services reform c) improving labour productivity and d) enhancing environmental and social issues around industrial parks.  is a component of Jobs Compact Ethiopia  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;72,263,829. It works in the following sector(s): Employment creation, Material relief assistance and services, Industrial development.</narrative>
  </description>
